      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears:\nadjustment payment means a payment made in accordance with a\ndetermination that is continued in force by item 8 of Part 1 of\nSchedule 3 to the Australian Federal Police Legislation\nAmendment Act 2000 (including a payment made in accordance\nwith such a determination as amended or varied in accordance with\nthat item).\nAFP appointee means:\n(a) a Deputy Commissioner; or",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears:\nadjustment payment means a payment made in accordance with a\ndetermination that is continued in force by item 8 of Part 1 of\nSchedule 3 to the Australian Federal Police Legislation\nAmendment Act 2000 (including a payment made in accordance\nwith such a determination as amended or varied in accordance with\nthat item).\nAFP appointee means:\n(a) a Deputy Commissioner; or",
      "cml:asserts": [
