      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code applies to all offences against this\nAct.\nNote:\nChapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of\ncriminal responsibility.",
