      "values:originalText": "(5) This Division, in so far as it protects the individual, is in addition\nto, and not in derogation of, any rights and freedoms of the\nindividual, whether under the law of the Commonwealth or of a\nState or Territory, and this Division is not intended to exclude or\nlimit the operation of any law of the Commonwealth or of a State\nor Territory providing for those rights and freedoms in so far as it\nis capable of operating concurrently with this Division.",
