      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the designated person is a protective service officer, the\ndesignated person must ensure that the thing is delivered into the\ncustody of a police officer as soon as practicable.",
