      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "(2) While a person is acting as Commissioner or as a Deputy\nCommissioner under subsection (1), he or she has, and may\nexercise, all the powers (except a power to make a declaration\nunder subsection 40D(4)), and shall perform all the functions and\nduties, of the Commissioner or of the Deputy Commissioner, as the\ncase may be.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) While a person is acting as Commissioner or as a Deputy\nCommissioner under subsection (1), he or she has, and may\nexercise, all the powers (except a power to make a declaration\nunder subsection 40D(4)), and shall perform all the functions and\nduties, of the Commissioner or of the Deputy Commissioner, as the\ncase may be.",
