      "skos:note": "Duties of Acting Commissioner and Deputy Commissioner during vacancy"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-18-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "18(2) Acting Commissioner and Deputy Commissioner during vacancy",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 54,
      "values:originalText": "(2) While a person is acting as Commissioner or as a Deputy\nCommissioner under subsection (1), he or she has, and may\nexercise, all the powers (except a power to make a declaration\nunder subsection 40D(4)), and shall perform all the functions and\nduties, of the Commissioner or of the Deputy Commissioner, as the\ncase may be."
    },
