      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In spite of this section, an AFP employee who:\n(a) is a member of the superannuation scheme established by\ndeed under the Superannuation Act 1990; and",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In spite of this section, an AFP employee who:\n(a) is a member of the superannuation scheme established by\ndeed under the Superannuation Act 1990; and",
      "values:partOf": {
