    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-33-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "33(1) Time when retirement on invalidity grounds takes effect",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If an AFP employee has consented to being retired under\nsubsection 32(1), the employee’s retirement takes effect on the day\nspecified in the notice under that subsection. The day specified\nmust not be before the day on which the notice is given to the\nemployee.\nAFP employee does not consent to retirement"
