      "skos:definition": "(2) However, any information or answer so given or any document so\nproduced is not admissible in evidence against the AFP appointee\nin any proceedings.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40a"
      },
