      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.75",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to any information or answer so\ngiven, or any document so produced, that is relevant to conducting\na test under section 40M or 40N (about testing for alcohol or\nprohibited drugs)\nNote:\nSection 40Q deals with the admissibility of such information etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to any information or answer so\ngiven, or any document so produced, that is relevant to conducting\na test under section 40M or 40N (about testing for alcohol or\nprohibited drugs)\nNote:\nSection 40Q deals with the admissibility of such information etc.",
