      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 78,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commissioner may, on such terms and conditions as he or she\ndetermines in writing, appoint a person as a special member of the\nAustralian Federal Police to assist in the performance of its\nfunctions.\nNote:\nThe Commissioner may, under section 35A, authorise special\npayments to special members."
    },
