      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The statement must:\n(a) be made in a form and manner required by the\nCommissioner; and\n(b) contain any information required by the Commissioner about\nthe financial affairs of the person during a period, or each\nperiod, specified by the Commissioner; and\n(c) be accompanied by any documents required by the\nCommissioner.\nTime limit for giving statement",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The statement must:\n(a) be made in a form and manner required by the\nCommissioner; and\n(b) contain any information required by the Commissioner about\nthe financial affairs of the person during a period, or each\nperiod, specified by the Commissioner; and\n(c) be accompanied by any documents required by the\nCommissioner.\nTime limit for giving statement",
