      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 92,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsection (3) does not apply if the text cannot be made so\navailable without infringing copyright.\n\n\nCommissioner’s command powers etc.  Part IV\nDrug testing  Division 8\nSection 40PA\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025"
    },
