    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rf-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40RF(4) Assignment of members, and special members, to unit",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40rf-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.98",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the Commissioner is satisfied that there are special reasons for\ndoing so, the Commissioner may vary, or further vary, the\nassignment under subsection (1) by substituting for the period\nspecified in the assignment a shorter or longer period.\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nPreliminary  Division 1\nSection 40RG\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the Commissioner is satisfied that there are special reasons for\ndoing so, the Commissioner may vary, or further vary, the\nassignment under subsection (1) by substituting for the period\nspecified in the assignment a shorter or longer period.\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nPreliminary  Division 1\nSection 40RG\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rf-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rf-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "710d60b04a67d76e1acc4e832cd4c99efc70abd40e7b9b002f9247a7c3d343bf",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner may vary assignment of members to unit under special reasons."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40rf-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40RF(4) Assignment of members, and special members, to unit",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the Commissioner is satisfied that there are special reasons for\ndoing so, the Commissioner may vary, or further vary, the\nassignment under subsection (1) by substituting for the period\nspecified in the assignment a shorter or longer period.\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nPreliminary  Division 1\nSection 40RG\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025"
    },
