    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rf-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40RF(7) Assignment of members, and special members, to unit",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40rf-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.98",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If:\n(a) a member, or special member, of the Australian Federal\nPolice is assigned to the unit constituted under section 40RD;\nand\n(b) the member, or special member, ceases to serve in the unit;\nand\n(c) the period of 12 months from the time when the member, or\nspecial member, ceased to serve in the unit ends;\nthe member, or special member, may again be assigned to the unit.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If:\n(a) a member, or special member, of the Australian Federal\nPolice is assigned to the unit constituted under section 40RD;\nand\n(b) the member, or special member, ceases to serve in the unit;\nand\n(c) the period of 12 months from the time when the member, or\nspecial member, ceased to serve in the unit ends;\nthe member, or special member, may again be assigned to the unit.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rf-ss-7-norm"
        },
