    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ri-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40RI(3) AFP practices issues",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40ri-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.100",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this Act, the practices or procedures of the\nAustralian Federal Police include:\n(a) the rules, orders and instructions (including the\nCommissioner’s Orders) in accordance with which AFP\nappointees are required to perform their duties; and\n(b) the policies adopted or followed by the Australian Federal\nPolice; and\n(c) the practices and procedures ordinarily followed by AFP\nappointees in the performance of their duties.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of this Act, the practices or procedures of the\nAustralian Federal Police include:\n(a) the rules, orders and instructions (including the\nCommissioner’s Orders) in accordance with which AFP\nappointees are required to perform their duties; and\n(b) the policies adopted or followed by the Australian Federal\nPolice; and\n(c) the practices and procedures ordinarily followed by AFP\nappointees in the performance of their duties.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ri"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ri-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0191634f86e10600f5079bbe609d00a28e8d5ac08b132a4ed9e8322f898f00c1",
      "skos:note": "Defines practices and procedures of the Australian Federal Police."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40ri-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40RI(3) AFP practices issues",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 100,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this Act, the practices or procedures of the\nAustralian Federal Police include:\n(a) the rules, orders and instructions (including the\nCommissioner’s Orders) in accordance with which AFP\nappointees are required to perform their duties; and\n(b) the policies adopted or followed by the Australian Federal\nPolice; and\n(c) the practices and procedures ordinarily followed by AFP\nappointees in the performance of their duties."
    },
