    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rj",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40RJ Exclusion of certain employment action",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40rj"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, an AFP conduct issue does not\ninclude an issue that relates to conduct of a person that is conduct\nthat:\n(a) consists of action taken in relation to an AFP appointee’s\nemployment; and\n(b) involves neither:\n(i) a contravention by the person of the AFP professional\nstandards; nor\n(ii) corrupt conduct by the person.\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, an AFP practices issue does not\ninclude an issue that relates a practice or procedure of the\nAustralian Federal Police that is a practice or procedure that:\n(a) relates to action taken in relation to AFP appointees’\nemployment; and\n(b) involves neither:\n(i) contraventions the AFP professional standards; nor",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, an AFP conduct issue does not\ninclude an issue that relates to conduct of a person that is conduct\nthat:\n(a) consists of action taken in relation to an AFP appointee’s\nemployment; and\n(b) involves neither:\n(i) a contravention by the person of the AFP professional\nstandards; nor\n(ii) corrupt conduct by the person.\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, an AFP practices issue does not\ninclude an issue that relates a practice or procedure of the\nAustralian Federal Police that is a practice or procedure that:\n(a) relates to action taken in relation to AFP appointees’\nemployment; and\n(b) involves neither:\n(i) contraventions the AFP professional standards; nor",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rj-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40rj-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0aee57af3aad16397a4294d3328fea3485e1be9965e39fc030a09daf79da6398"
    },
    {
