      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Act, an AFP practices issue does not\ninclude an issue that relates a practice or procedure of the\nAustralian Federal Police that is a practice or procedure that:\n(a) relates to action taken in relation to AFP appointees’\nemployment; and\n(b) involves neither:\n(i) contraventions the AFP professional standards; nor",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Act, an AFP practices issue does not\ninclude an issue that relates a practice or procedure of the\nAustralian Federal Police that is a practice or procedure that:\n(a) relates to action taken in relation to AFP appointees’\nemployment; and\n(b) involves neither:\n(i) contraventions the AFP professional standards; nor",
