      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to sections 40RN, 40RO and 40RP, the Commissioner and\nthe Ombudsman may jointly determine, by legislative instrument:\n(a) the kind of conduct that is to be category 1 conduct for the\npurposes of this Act; and\n(b) the kind of conduct that is to be category 2 conduct for the\npurposes of this Act; and\n(c) the kind of conduct that is to be category 3 conduct for the\npurposes of this Act.",
