      "skos:definition": "(1) If a person gives information to another person (the recipient)\nunder section 40SA, the recipient must:\n(a) record the details of the information; and\n(b) deal with the information in accordance with the\nCommissioner’s orders issued for the purposes of\nsubsection 40TA(1).",
