    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40se",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40SE Recording and dealing with information referred under",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40se"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.110",
      "values:originalText": "section 40SD\nIf the Commissioner decides under section 40SD that an AFP\nconduct issue is to be dealt with under this Part, the Commissioner\nmust:\n(a) record the details of the information; and\n(b) deal with the issue in accordance with the Commissioner’s\norders issued for the purposes of subsection 40TA(1).\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nDealing with AFP conduct or practices issues  Division 3\nSection 40TA\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025",
      "skos:definition": "section 40SD\nIf the Commissioner decides under section 40SD that an AFP\nconduct issue is to be dealt with under this Part, the Commissioner\nmust:\n(a) record the details of the information; and\n(b) deal with the issue in accordance with the Commissioner’s\norders issued for the purposes of subsection 40TA(1).\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nDealing with AFP conduct or practices issues  Division 3\nSection 40TA\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40se-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40se-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a93e5cb7e39abfc9b071241eb0bd89e930d6da51974ff93af41f0e1307151451",
      "skos:note": "The Commissioner must record and deal with an AFP conduct issue in accordance with orders."
    },
    {
