    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tc-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40TC(2) Training and development action",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40tc-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.112",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), training and development action\nin relation to the AFP appointee may take one or more of the\nfollowing forms:\n(a) coaching the AFP appointee or making arrangements for the\nAFP appointee to be coached;\n(b) mentoring the AFP appointee or making arrangements for the\nAFP appointee to be mentored;\n(c) making arrangements for the AFP appointee to undertake\ntraining activities;\n(d) making arrangements for the AFP appointee to undertake\ndevelopment activities;\n(e) increasing, or making arrangements for increasing, the level\nof supervision of the AFP appointee’s work.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), training and development action\nin relation to the AFP appointee may take one or more of the\nfollowing forms:\n(a) coaching the AFP appointee or making arrangements for the\nAFP appointee to be coached;\n(b) mentoring the AFP appointee or making arrangements for the\nAFP appointee to be mentored;\n(c) making arrangements for the AFP appointee to undertake\ntraining activities;\n(d) making arrangements for the AFP appointee to undertake\ndevelopment activities;\n(e) increasing, or making arrangements for increasing, the level\nof supervision of the AFP appointee’s work.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tc"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tc-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tc-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "103b39558d306a88ca490b625e0cc27db9740f2a9c76d58546f937545ac3135a",
      "skos:note": "Training and development action for AFP appointee"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40tc-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40TC(2) Training and development action",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 112,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), training and development action\nin relation to the AFP appointee may take one or more of the\nfollowing forms:\n(a) coaching the AFP appointee or making arrangements for the\nAFP appointee to be coached;\n(b) mentoring the AFP appointee or making arrangements for the\nAFP appointee to be mentored;\n(c) making arrangements for the AFP appointee to undertake\ntraining activities;\n(d) making arrangements for the AFP appointee to undertake\ndevelopment activities;\n(e) increasing, or making arrangements for increasing, the level\nof supervision of the AFP appointee’s work."
    },
    {
