      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if:\n(a) a person gives information under section 40SA that raises:\n(i) an AFP conduct issue in relation to conduct engaged in\nby an AFP appointee; or\n(ii) an AFP practices issue in relation to a practice or\nprocedure of the AFP; or\n(b) the Commissioner decides under section 40SD that an AFP\nconduct issue in relation to an AFP appointee is to be dealt\nwith under this Part.",
