      "cof:title": "40TF(2) Discretion to take no further action in relation to AFP conduct",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 115,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commissioner may determine that no further action is to be\ntaken under this Part in relation to the issue if the Commissioner is\nsatisfied that:\n(a) the person became aware of the conduct, or the practice or\nprocedure, more than 12 months before the person gave the\ninformation under section 40SA; or\n(b) appropriate action has already been taken:\n(i) against the AFP appointee in relation to the conduct; or\n(ii) in relation to the practice or procedure; or"
    },
    {
