      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.119",
      "values:originalText": "(2) This Subdivision also applies if:\n(a) the Commissioner decides under section 40SD that an AFP\nconduct issue in relation to an AFP appointee is to be dealt\nwith under this Part; and\n(b) the issue is a category 3 conduct issue or a corruption issue.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) This Subdivision also applies if:\n(a) the Commissioner decides under section 40SD that an AFP\nconduct issue in relation to an AFP appointee is to be dealt\nwith under this Part; and\n(b) the issue is a category 3 conduct issue or a corruption issue.",
