    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tn",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40TN Head of unit constituted under section 40RD generally",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40tn"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.120",
      "values:originalText": "allocates issues for investigation\n(1) Subject to subsection (3) and section 40TO, the head of the unit\nconstituted under section 40RD must allocate the issue to one or\nmore law enforcement officers (within the meaning of the Crimes\nAct 1914) for investigation.\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the head of the unit may allocate\nthe issue to himself or herself.\n(3) The head of the unit may allocate the issue to a person who is not a\nmember of the unit only with the Commissioner’s agreement.\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nDealing with AFP conduct or practices issues  Division 3\nSection 40TO\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025",
      "skos:definition": "allocates issues for investigation\n(1) Subject to subsection (3) and section 40TO, the head of the unit\nconstituted under section 40RD must allocate the issue to one or\nmore law enforcement officers (within the meaning of the Crimes\nAct 1914) for investigation.\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the head of the unit may allocate\nthe issue to himself or herself.\n(3) The head of the unit may allocate the issue to a person who is not a\nmember of the unit only with the Commissioner’s agreement.\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nDealing with AFP conduct or practices issues  Division 3\nSection 40TO\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tn-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tn-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tn-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2867a0b5077e37d1848ab483b86297a4eb07b9164ee48a5cb5abe599f192d629"
    },
