      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.121",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Without limiting subsection (2), the Commissioner may, with the\nagreement of the Ombudsman, allocate the issue to the\nOmbudsman if the issue is a category 3 conduct issue.",
