      "skos:note": "Commissioner must allocate issue to the Ombudsman if category 3 conduct issue."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40to-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40TO(5) Commissioner must allocate issue to someone outside unit",
