      "skos:note": "Consultation with Ombudsman required when allocating issue to someone outside unit"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40to-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40TO(6) Commissioner must allocate issue to someone outside unit",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 121,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n(a) the issue is a category 3 conduct issue; and\n(b) the Commissioner allocates the issue under subsection (2) to\nsomeone other than the Ombudsman;\nthe Commissioner must consult with the Ombudsman about the\nchoice of the person to whom the issue is to be allocated."
    },
