      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.124",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The investigator:\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nDealing with AFP conduct or practices issues  Division 3\nSection 40TX\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025\n(a) must identify the AFP practices issue in the report; and\n(b) may include in the report such recommendations as the\ninvestigator considers appropriate to address the AFP\npractices issue.\nSubdivision E—Dealing with AFP practices issues",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The investigator:\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nDealing with AFP conduct or practices issues  Division 3\nSection 40TX\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025\n(a) must identify the AFP practices issue in the report; and\n(b) may include in the report such recommendations as the\ninvestigator considers appropriate to address the AFP\npractices issue.\nSubdivision E—Dealing with AFP practices issues",
