    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ua",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40UA Minister may arrange special inquiries",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40ua"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.126",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, if he or she thinks it appropriate to do so,\narrange for an inquiry to be held, by such person or persons, and in\nsuch manner, as he or she determines, concerning:\n(a) any conduct engaged in by an AFP appointee; or\n(b) any matter relating to the practices or procedures of the\nAustralian Federal Police; or\n(c) any other matter relating to the Australian Federal Police.\n(2) Subsection (1) applies even if:\n(a) the conduct referred to in paragraph (1)(a) is:\n(i) being dealt with under Division 3; or\n(ii) the subject of a complaint made to the Ombudsman; or\n(b) the matter referred to in paragraph (1)(b) is:\n(i) a practice or procedure that is being dealt with under",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, if he or she thinks it appropriate to do so,\narrange for an inquiry to be held, by such person or persons, and in\nsuch manner, as he or she determines, concerning:\n(a) any conduct engaged in by an AFP appointee; or\n(b) any matter relating to the practices or procedures of the\nAustralian Federal Police; or\n(c) any other matter relating to the Australian Federal Police.\n(2) Subsection (1) applies even if:\n(a) the conduct referred to in paragraph (1)(a) is:\n(i) being dealt with under Division 3; or\n(ii) the subject of a complaint made to the Ombudsman; or\n(b) the matter referred to in paragraph (1)(b) is:\n(i) a practice or procedure that is being dealt with under",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ua-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ua-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5e0ab1fd6d60c292d949d70ee40e996fe9fe527651deef81100c1d933c0c1953"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40ua",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40UA Minister may arrange special inquiries",
