      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 127,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If an inquiry is held in accordance with arrangements made under\nsection 40UA, the person holding the inquiry:\n(a) must report to the Minister the results of the inquiry; and\n(b) may make such recommendations (if any) arising out of the\ninquiry as the person considers appropriate."
