    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40va-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40VA(2) Application of Division",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40va-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.129",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The powers provided for in this Division are in addition to any\nother powers the investigator may have.\nNote:\nFor example, if the investigator is a member, or special member, of\nthe Australian Federal Police and the investigation or inquiry involves\na possible criminal offence against a law of the Commonwealth, the\ninvestigator may have powers in relation to the investigation of\noffences against the laws of the Commonwealth.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The powers provided for in this Division are in addition to any\nother powers the investigator may have.\nNote:\nFor example, if the investigator is a member, or special member, of\nthe Australian Federal Police and the investigation or inquiry involves\na possible criminal offence against a law of the Commonwealth, the\ninvestigator may have powers in relation to the investigation of\noffences against the laws of the Commonwealth.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40va"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40va-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6bf48460ff726a473c50128e21888165ce9dab380aaeb700e6beb001155be559",
      "skos:note": "Powers provided in this Division are in addition to any other powers the investigator may have."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40va-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40VA(2) Application of Division",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 129,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The powers provided for in this Division are in addition to any\nother powers the investigator may have.\nNote:\nFor example, if the investigator is a member, or special member, of\nthe Australian Federal Police and the investigation or inquiry involves\na possible criminal offence against a law of the Commonwealth, the\ninvestigator may have powers in relation to the investigation of\noffences against the laws of the Commonwealth."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40va-ss-2-norm",
