    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40vd-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40VD(2) Relationship with other laws",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 130,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Nothing in subsection (1) affects the operation of any other\nprovision of this Division.\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nInvestigative powers  Division 5\nSection 40VE\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025"
    },
    {
