          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wa-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wa-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d7a7ab956aae6e5ae47a7482080062afd0d179de836bfef25a2d756cc7f3f91e",
      "skos:note": "The Commissioner must keep records of certain information and actions.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40wa-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40WA(2) Record keeping",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 138,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the Commissioner must ensure\nthat records are kept of:\n(a) information that is given under section 40SA; and\n(b) the action (if any) that is taken in relation to the AFP conduct\nor practices issue raised by that information; and\n(c) if the issue is an AFP conduct issue—the action (if any) that\nis taken in relation to any AFP practices issue that is:\n(i) brought, under section 40TK, to the attention of an AFP\nappointee; or\n(ii) identified, under section 40TW, in a report prepared\nunder section 40TU;\nas a result of the AFP conduct issue being dealt with under\nthis Part."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wa-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wa-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wa-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
