      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.138",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply if subsection 40SC(2) (which deals\nwith category 1 conduct issues that are resolved without being\nrecorded) applies to the information.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply if subsection 40SC(2) (which deals\nwith category 1 conduct issues that are resolved without being\nrecorded) applies to the information.",
      "values:partOf": {
