      "skos:note": "Access to records for Ombudsman's functions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40wa-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40WA(5) Record keeping",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 138,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Without limiting section 40XC, the Ombudsman is entitled to have\naccess to the records kept under this section for the purposes of\nperforming the Ombudsman’s functions.\n\n\nProfessional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V\nRecord keeping  Division 6\nSection 40WB\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025"
    },
