    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40WB Records about corruption issues",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40wb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.139",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The National Anti-Corruption Commissioner may direct the\nCommissioner that access to information about a corruption issue\nis to be restricted in the way specified in the direction.\nNote:\nFor example, the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner might\ndirect that the information that would otherwise be entered on a\ndatabase is not to be entered on the database or that, if the information\nis entered on a database, access to the information on the database is\nto be restricted in some way.\n(2) The Commissioner must comply with the direction.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The National Anti-Corruption Commissioner may direct the\nCommissioner that access to information about a corruption issue\nis to be restricted in the way specified in the direction.\nNote:\nFor example, the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner might\ndirect that the information that would otherwise be entered on a\ndatabase is not to be entered on the database or that, if the information\nis entered on a database, access to the information on the database is\nto be restricted in some way.\n(2) The Commissioner must comply with the direction.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wb-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wb-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "07a0a870a4551917f99a983be8bbc69bb14022c46947c619259d0a724732c31d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40wb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40WB Records about corruption issues",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 139,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The National Anti-Corruption Commissioner may direct the\nCommissioner that access to information about a corruption issue\nis to be restricted in the way specified in the direction.\nNote:\nFor example, the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner might\ndirect that the information that would otherwise be entered on a\ndatabase is not to be entered on the database or that, if the information\nis entered on a database, access to the information on the database is\nto be restricted in some way.\n(2) The Commissioner must comply with the direction."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wb-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40WB(1) Records about corruption issues",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40wb-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.139",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The National Anti-Corruption Commissioner may direct the\nCommissioner that access to information about a corruption issue\nis to be restricted in the way specified in the direction.\nNote:\nFor example, the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner might\ndirect that the information that would otherwise be entered on a\ndatabase is not to be entered on the database or that, if the information\nis entered on a database, access to the information on the database is\nto be restricted in some way.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The National Anti-Corruption Commissioner may direct the\nCommissioner that access to information about a corruption issue\nis to be restricted in the way specified in the direction.\nNote:\nFor example, the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner might\ndirect that the information that would otherwise be entered on a\ndatabase is not to be entered on the database or that, if the information\nis entered on a database, access to the information on the database is\nto be restricted in some way.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wb-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wb-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f6f1106faf18dade0d39a4735dce860acb9496a36a939ad681cccd5075bdc651",
      "skos:note": "Directs the Commissioner to restrict access to information about a corruption issue."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-40wb-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40WB(1) Records about corruption issues",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 139,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The National Anti-Corruption Commissioner may direct the\nCommissioner that access to information about a corruption issue\nis to be restricted in the way specified in the direction.\nNote:\nFor example, the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner might\ndirect that the information that would otherwise be entered on a\ndatabase is not to be entered on the database or that, if the information\nis entered on a database, access to the information on the database is\nto be restricted in some way."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40wb-ss-1-norm",
