      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a person (other than an AFP appointee or\nthe Ombudsman) who conducts:\n(a) an investigation of a category 3 conduct issue or a corruption\nissue under Subdivision D of Division 3; or\n(b) an inquiry under Division 4.\nNote 1:\nAFP appointees are covered by the confidentiality requirements of\nsection 60A.\nNote 2:\nThe Ombudsman is covered by the confidentiality requirements of\nsection 35 of the Ombudsman Act 1976."
