      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.144",
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of this section, the appropriate person is:\n(a) the Minister in relation to a person who is conducting, or has\nconducted, an inquiry under Division 4; and\n(b) the Commissioner in relation to any other person to whom\nthis section applies.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) For the purposes of this section, the appropriate person is:\n(a) the Minister in relation to a person who is conducting, or has\nconducted, an inquiry under Division 4; and\n(b) the Commissioner in relation to any other person to whom\nthis section applies.",
      "values:partOf": {
