      "cml:premiseText": "(i) that is a subsidiary of another body corporate mentioned in paragraph (a) or (b); and",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...an unincorporated authority or body..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-41-logic-alleninterval-3",
