      "cml:premiseText": "Schedule 1 to the Australian Federal Police Legislation Amendment Act 1999 commences.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the day on which Schedule 1 to the Australian Federal Police Legislation Amendment Act 1999 commences."
    },
