      "cml:conclusionText": "Documents under seal overlap with court finding"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-45a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45A(3) Application for superannuation order: evidence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-45a-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.158",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In an application for a superannuation order in respect of a person,\na certificate signed or sealed by the person’s superannuation\nauthority:\n(a) stating that employer contributions or benefits made or\npayable by the Commonwealth or a specified\nCommonwealth organisation in respect of the person are held\nin a specified fund under the relevant superannuation\nscheme; and\n(b) stating the amount that equals the sum of those contributions\nor benefits as at the specified day plus the amount of interest\non those contributions or benefits accrued under the scheme\nbefore that day;\nis prima facie evidence of the matters stated in the certificate.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In an application for a superannuation order in respect of a person,\na certificate signed or sealed by the person’s superannuation\nauthority:\n(a) stating that employer contributions or benefits made or\npayable by the Commonwealth or a specified\nCommonwealth organisation in respect of the person are held\nin a specified fund under the relevant superannuation\nscheme; and\n(b) stating the amount that equals the sum of those contributions\nor benefits as at the specified day plus the amount of interest\non those contributions or benefits accrued under the scheme\nbefore that day;\nis prima facie evidence of the matters stated in the certificate.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-45a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-45a-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-45a-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-45a-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d9c86a10c0d4895a66e141d902b68d31c6b889db7e991fa94887165a11bf7869",
      "skos:note": "Prima facie evidence of employer contributions or benefits",
      "dc:description": "Certificate signed or sealed by the person's superannuation authority"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-45a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45A(3) Application for superannuation order: evidence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 158,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In an application for a superannuation order in respect of a person,\na certificate signed or sealed by the person’s superannuation\nauthority:\n(a) stating that employer contributions or benefits made or\npayable by the Commonwealth or a specified\nCommonwealth organisation in respect of the person are held\nin a specified fund under the relevant superannuation\nscheme; and\n(b) stating the amount that equals the sum of those contributions\nor benefits as at the specified day plus the amount of interest\non those contributions or benefits accrued under the scheme\nbefore that day;\nis prima facie evidence of the matters stated in the certificate."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-45a-ss-3-norm",
