      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.158",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A document purporting to be sealed with the seal of a court is to be\ntaken to have been lawfully sealed with the seal of that court unless\nthe contrary is proved.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A document purporting to be sealed with the seal of a court is to be\ntaken to have been lawfully sealed with the seal of that court unless\nthe contrary is proved.",
      "values:partOf": {
