    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-47a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "47A(2) Superannuation orders: variation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-47a-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.164",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Where an application is made, the court must vary the\nsuperannuation order accordingly and, for the purposes of working\nout the increased amount to be specified in the superannuation\norder, as varied, subsections 46(3), (4) and (5) apply as if\nreferences in subsections 46(3) and (4) to the day on which the\norder is made were references to the day on which the variation is\nmade.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Where an application is made, the court must vary the\nsuperannuation order accordingly and, for the purposes of working\nout the increased amount to be specified in the superannuation\norder, as varied, subsections 46(3), (4) and (5) apply as if\nreferences in subsections 46(3) and (4) to the day on which the\norder is made were references to the day on which the variation is\nmade.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-47a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-47a-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-47a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c4cc0c4b87645a05e3e9a5413d6243ba423cc2dbbfa4108d628b5ab04da71735",
      "skos:note": "Court must vary superannuation order upon application."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-47a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47A(2) Superannuation orders: variation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 164,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Where an application is made, the court must vary the\nsuperannuation order accordingly and, for the purposes of working\nout the increased amount to be specified in the superannuation\norder, as varied, subsections 46(3), (4) and (5) apply as if\nreferences in subsections 46(3) and (4) to the day on which the\norder is made were references to the day on which the variation is\nmade."
    },
