      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.166",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A court may make a restraining order against property whether or\nnot there is any risk of the property being disposed of, or otherwise\ndealt with, in a manner that would defeat the operation of this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A court may make a restraining order against property whether or\nnot there is any risk of the property being disposed of, or otherwise\ndealt with, in a manner that would defeat the operation of this Part.",
