      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 169,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The DPP must give written notice of an application under\nsubsection (1) for the extension of a restraining order to:\n(a) the owner of the property against which the restraining order\nwas made; and\n(b) any other person who the DPP has reason to believe may\nhave an interest in the property."
    },
