      "values:originalText": "(3) A charge on property:\n(a) is subject to every encumbrance on the property that came\ninto existence before the charge and that would, but for this\nsubsection, have priority over the charge; and\n(b) has priority over all other encumbrances; and\n(c) subject to subsection (2), is not affected by any change of\nownership of the property.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A charge on property:\n(a) is subject to every encumbrance on the property that came\ninto existence before the charge and that would, but for this\nsubsection, have priority over the charge; and\n(b) has priority over all other encumbrances; and\n(c) subject to subsection (2), is not affected by any change of\nownership of the property.",
