      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.177",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person who applies under section 49J for an ancillary order in\nrelation to a restraining order must give written notice of the\napplication to each other person who is entitled under\nsubsection 49J(2) to make an application under section 49J in\nrelation to the restraining order.\n(2) A person who applies under section 49N for revocation of a\nrestraining order must give written notice of the application to the\nDPP.",
