    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "54 Amounts payable under section 46, 47, 47B or 51",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-54"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.180",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where an amount is payable under an order made under\nsubsection 46(3) in respect of employer contributions or benefits\nthat are held in a fund (other than the Consolidated Revenue Fund),\nthe amount is payable out of the fund by the person responsible for\nthe administration of the fund.\n(2) Where an amount is payable under an order made under\nsubsection 46(3) in respect of employer contributions or benefits\nthat have been paid to the Commonwealth, the Finance Minister is\nto make arrangements:\n(a) for the payment of the amount out of the Consolidated\nRevenue Fund; or\n(b) where it is not appropriate to make such a payment—for any\nother appropriate action to be taken;\nand the order is to be taken to have been satisfied by the taking of\nany action that gives effect to the arrangements.\n(3) An amount payable to a person under subsection 47(2) or (3) or\n51(3) is payable:\n(a) if the relevant superannuation scheme is established by an\nAct—by the Commonwealth; and\n(b) in any other case—by the relevant superannuation authority\nout of the fund established under the relevant superannuation\nscheme.\n(4) Where an amount mentioned in subsection (3) is payable by the\nCommonwealth, the amount is payable out of the fund established\n\n\nLoss of certain superannuation rights and benefits  Part VA\nMiscellaneous  Division 4\nSection 54A\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025\nunder the relevant Act or, if an amount equal to the employer\ncontributions of the person has been paid to the Commonwealth,\nout of the Consolidated Revenue Fund.\n(5) An amount payable to a person under section 47B is payable by the\nCommonwealth out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund.\n(6) The Consolidated Revenue Fund is appropriated to the extent\nnecessary to pay any amount that is payable under this section out\nof that Fund.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Where an amount is payable under an order made under\nsubsection 46(3) in respect of employer contributions or benefits\nthat are held in a fund (other than the Consolidated Revenue Fund),\nthe amount is payable out of the fund by the person responsible for\nthe administration of the fund.\n(2) Where an amount is payable under an order made under\nsubsection 46(3) in respect of employer contributions or benefits\nthat have been paid to the Commonwealth, the Finance Minister is\nto make arrangements:\n(a) for the payment of the amount out of the Consolidated\nRevenue Fund; or\n(b) where it is not appropriate to make such a payment—for any\nother appropriate action to be taken;\nand the order is to be taken to have been satisfied by the taking of\nany action that gives effect to the arrangements.\n(3) An amount payable to a person under subsection 47(2) or (3) or\n51(3) is payable:\n(a) if the relevant superannuation scheme is established by an\nAct—by the Commonwealth; and\n(b) in any other case—by the relevant superannuation authority\nout of the fund established under the relevant superannuation\nscheme.\n(4) Where an amount mentioned in subsection (3) is payable by the\nCommonwealth, the amount is payable out of the fund established\n\n\nLoss of certain superannuation rights and benefits  Part VA\nMiscellaneous  Division 4\nSection 54A\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025\nunder the relevant Act or, if an amount equal to the employer\ncontributions of the person has been paid to the Commonwealth,\nout of the Consolidated Revenue Fund.\n(5) An amount payable to a person under section 47B is payable by the\nCommonwealth out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund.\n(6) The Consolidated Revenue Fund is appropriated to the extent\nnecessary to pay any amount that is payable under this section out\nof that Fund.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54-ss-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54-ss-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5f70eb2331360392165228f1f52813a4bb0e67ef5ad48e9322901c6319e87d5f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-54",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54 Amounts payable under section 46, 47, 47B or 51",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 180,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where an amount is payable under an order made under\nsubsection 46(3) in respect of employer contributions or benefits\nthat are held in a fund (other than the Consolidated Revenue Fund),\nthe amount is payable out of the fund by the person responsible for\nthe administration of the fund.\n(2) Where an amount is payable under an order made under\nsubsection 46(3) in respect of employer contributions or benefits\nthat have been paid to the Commonwealth, the Finance Minister is\nto make arrangements:\n(a) for the payment of the amount out of the Consolidated\nRevenue Fund; or\n(b) where it is not appropriate to make such a payment—for any\nother appropriate action to be taken;\nand the order is to be taken to have been satisfied by the taking of\nany action that gives effect to the arrangements.\n(3) An amount payable to a person under subsection 47(2) or (3) or\n51(3) is payable:\n(a) if the relevant superannuation scheme is established by an\nAct—by the Commonwealth; and\n(b) in any other case—by the relevant superannuation authority\nout of the fund established under the relevant superannuation\nscheme.\n(4) Where an amount mentioned in subsection (3) is payable by the\nCommonwealth, the amount is payable out of the fund established\n\n\nLoss of certain superannuation rights and benefits  Part VA\nMiscellaneous  Division 4\nSection 54A\nAustralian Federal Police Act 1979\nCompilation date: 08/11/2025\nunder the relevant Act or, if an amount equal to the employer\ncontributions of the person has been paid to the Commonwealth,\nout of the Consolidated Revenue Fund.\n(5) An amount payable to a person under section 47B is payable by the\nCommonwealth out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund.\n(6) The Consolidated Revenue Fund is appropriated to the extent\nnecessary to pay any amount that is payable under this section out\nof that Fund."
    },
