    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "54A Multiple payments in respect of same employee contributions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-54a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.181",
      "values:originalText": "not allowed\n(1) In spite of this Act and the Superannuation Benefits Act, where an\namount has been paid to a person under subsection 47(2) or (3) or\n51(3) of this Act in respect of employee contributions and interest\non those contributions, the person is not entitled to payment of\nanother amount under any of those subsections, or under\nsubsection 21(4) or (5) of the Superannuation Benefits Act.\n(2) In respect of this Act and the Superannuation Benefits Act, where\nan amount has been paid to a person under subsection 21(4) or (5)\nof the Superannuation Benefits Act in respect of employee\ncontributions and interest on those contributions, the person is not\nentitled to payment of another amount under subsection 47(2) or\n(3) or 51(3) of this Act in respect of the same employee\ncontributions and interest.\n(3) In this section:\nSuperannuation Benefits Act means the Crimes (Superannuation\nBenefits) Act 1989.",
      "skos:definition": "not allowed\n(1) In spite of this Act and the Superannuation Benefits Act, where an\namount has been paid to a person under subsection 47(2) or (3) or\n51(3) of this Act in respect of employee contributions and interest\non those contributions, the person is not entitled to payment of\nanother amount under any of those subsections, or under\nsubsection 21(4) or (5) of the Superannuation Benefits Act.\n(2) In respect of this Act and the Superannuation Benefits Act, where\nan amount has been paid to a person under subsection 21(4) or (5)\nof the Superannuation Benefits Act in respect of employee\ncontributions and interest on those contributions, the person is not\nentitled to payment of another amount under subsection 47(2) or\n(3) or 51(3) of this Act in respect of the same employee\ncontributions and interest.\n(3) In this section:\nSuperannuation Benefits Act means the Crimes (Superannuation\nBenefits) Act 1989.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54a-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54a-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54a-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a26075ed2e784cb181eaabb10acd083520d311bc68b4b7d00d57de825bb3ec86"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-54a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54A Multiple payments in respect of same employee contributions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 181,
      "values:originalText": "not allowed\n(1) In spite of this Act and the Superannuation Benefits Act, where an\namount has been paid to a person under subsection 47(2) or (3) or\n51(3) of this Act in respect of employee contributions and interest\non those contributions, the person is not entitled to payment of\nanother amount under any of those subsections, or under\nsubsection 21(4) or (5) of the Superannuation Benefits Act.\n(2) In respect of this Act and the Superannuation Benefits Act, where\nan amount has been paid to a person under subsection 21(4) or (5)\nof the Superannuation Benefits Act in respect of employee\ncontributions and interest on those contributions, the person is not\nentitled to payment of another amount under subsection 47(2) or\n(3) or 51(3) of this Act in respect of the same employee\ncontributions and interest.\n(3) In this section:\nSuperannuation Benefits Act means the Crimes (Superannuation\nBenefits) Act 1989."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54a-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "54A(1) Multiple payments in respect of same employee contributions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-54a-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.181",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In spite of this Act and the Superannuation Benefits Act, where an\namount has been paid to a person under subsection 47(2) or (3) or\n51(3) of this Act in respect of employee contributions and interest\non those contributions, the person is not entitled to payment of\nanother amount under any of those subsections, or under\nsubsection 21(4) or (5) of the Superannuation Benefits Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In spite of this Act and the Superannuation Benefits Act, where an\namount has been paid to a person under subsection 47(2) or (3) or\n51(3) of this Act in respect of employee contributions and interest\non those contributions, the person is not entitled to payment of\nanother amount under any of those subsections, or under\nsubsection 21(4) or (5) of the Superannuation Benefits Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-54a"
