    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-63",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "63 Personation etc. of member or special member",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-63"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.186",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person, not being a member or special member, shall not:\n(b) wear or display any uniform or badge of a member or special\nmember, any colourable imitation of such a uniform or\nbadge, or any uniform or badge so closely resembling such a\nuniform or badge as to be likely to deceive;\n(c) have in his or her possession any arms or ammunition, or any\narticle of clothing, accoutrements or equipment, supplied to\nany member or special member.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months.\n(2) Paragraphs (1)(b) and (c) do not apply if the person has a\nreasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person, not being a member or special member, shall not:\n(b) wear or display any uniform or badge of a member or special\nmember, any colourable imitation of such a uniform or\nbadge, or any uniform or badge so closely resembling such a\nuniform or badge as to be likely to deceive;\n(c) have in his or her possession any arms or ammunition, or any\narticle of clothing, accoutrements or equipment, supplied to\nany member or special member.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months.\n(2) Paragraphs (1)(b) and (c) do not apply if the person has a\nreasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-63-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-63-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "49b2c8377867018594d3cd8dd310b33d4dcb70a2a6b3fd9a7c5d903a01d9cc09"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-63",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "63 Personation etc. of member or special member",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 186,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person, not being a member or special member, shall not:\n(b) wear or display any uniform or badge of a member or special\nmember, any colourable imitation of such a uniform or\nbadge, or any uniform or badge so closely resembling such a\nuniform or badge as to be likely to deceive;\n(c) have in his or her possession any arms or ammunition, or any\narticle of clothing, accoutrements or equipment, supplied to\nany member or special member.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months.\n(2) Paragraphs (1)(b) and (c) do not apply if the person has a\nreasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-63-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "63(1) Personation etc. of member or special member",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-63-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
