    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-67-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "67(3) Annual reports",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 192,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commissioner may, by writing signed by the Commissioner,\ncertify that a specified person has been appointed as a special\nmember under section 40E and may also certify all or any of the\nfollowing in relation to the person:\n(a) that he or she entered into the undertaking mentioned in\nsubsection 36(4) immediately after his or her appointment;\n(b) that, on a specified date, he or she made and subscribed the\noath or affirmation mentioned in the certificate before the\nCommissioner or a specified person authorised by the\nCommissioner for the purposes of subsection 36(4);\n(c) that he or she is, on the date on which the certificate is\nsigned, a special member and has been such a special\nmember continuously since he or she was so appointed.\nCertification that a person is or is not a member or special member"
    },
