    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-68a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "68A(3) Certificates in relation to transferred PSOs",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-68a-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.195",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commissioner may also certify either or both of the following\nin relation to the person:\n(a) that the person made and subscribed an oath or affirmation\nunder section 10 of the Australian Protective Service Act\n1987;\n(b) that the person is, on the date on which the certificate is\nsigned, a protective service officer and has been such a\nprotective service officer continuously since being appointed\nunder section 9 of the Australian Protective Service Act\n1987.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commissioner may also certify either or both of the following\nin relation to the person:\n(a) that the person made and subscribed an oath or affirmation\nunder section 10 of the Australian Protective Service Act\n1987;\n(b) that the person is, on the date on which the certificate is\nsigned, a protective service officer and has been such a\nprotective service officer continuously since being appointed\nunder section 9 of the Australian Protective Service Act\n1987.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-68a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-68a-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-68a-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "39a8d9c1234539e0667106013b29c2fba89ec75e04cf2cca6df04eee9878771e",
      "skos:note": "The Commissioner must certify certain information about a person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-federal-police-act-1979#sec-68a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "68A(3) Certificates in relation to transferred PSOs",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 195,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commissioner may also certify either or both of the following\nin relation to the person:\n(a) that the person made and subscribed an oath or affirmation\nunder section 10 of the Australian Protective Service Act\n1987;\n(b) that the person is, on the date on which the certificate is\nsigned, a protective service officer and has been such a\nprotective service officer continuously since being appointed\nunder section 9 of the Australian Protective Service Act\n1987."
    },
